<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Kalanga Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">1 PHETHIRO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo Gwekutanga GWAPHETHIRO</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 PHETHIRO</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pheth</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo Gwekutanga</para>
  <para style="mt1">GWAPHETHIRO</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lukwalo gunobva kuna Phethiro gwekutanga </char> gwakakwagwa ndimpositoli Phethiro. Phethiro unotangisa lukwalo gugwe ngezwitula kuti ndiye yani kakale nekuti unokwalila yani. Wakakwala lukwalo igogu ekwalila ose maKhirisitu, waka ebadana eti “bezi” (1 Phethiro 1.1, 1 Phethiro1.17, na 1 Phethiro 2.11). Lubaka gunjinji waka ebadana ejalo ibabo baaka ebakwalila ngobe baka bakapalalila muhango dzakasiyana siyana. Ngobe lukwalo igogu nedzimwe zila goyendidzana nelukwalo gunobva kuna Phawuli ekwalila bekuEfesu, banhu banjinji banokumbulila kuti lukwalo gunobva kuna Phethiro gwekutanga gwakakwagwa hule kwelukwalo gwebaEfesu kungaba makole ali matanhatu anamahanu hule kwezwagwa kwaKhirisitu. Phethiro wakakwala lukwalo igogu elikuRoma kwaadana eti Bhabhiloni (1 Phethiro 5.13)</para>
  <para style="ip">Phethiro unoleba kuti lukwalo igogu wakagukwala ngetjinangwa tjekuti, “amukuludzile kakale ape busupi gwekuti ikoku ingoni dzeNdzimu dzemalebeswa” (1 Phethiro 5.12). Kuna kunjinji kunoyendidzana pakati kwelukwalo gwaPhethiro gwekutanga (2.11-3.7), nelukwalo gwebaEfesu (5.18-6.9), nelukwalo gwebaKolose (3.18-4.6). Idzedzi ndima nhatu dzopa nlayo wegalisana mumizi neba nemazwibhato kubatungamili. Phethiro unokuludzila kakale maKhirisitu kuti adzikitidze hapa elimukudziyidzika ngobe bupelo gwabepedlo (4.1)</para>
  <para style="iot">Nlongoloso Yezwimukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Phethiro unozwitula kakale unolezwa banhu baanokwalila (1 Phethiro 1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Phethiro unoboka Ndzimu ngentha yejidzo labanalo bose nekuti ikoko kobvani mubutjilo gwabo (1 Phethiro 1.3-2.10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unotebela nelaya bagalimoyo kuti batjile tjini zwakanaka muhango kakale unoleba nekwegalisana zwakanaka kwakasiyana siyana sekwenlume nemfumakadzi uwe nenlanda nabatezi babe (1Phethiro 2.11-4.11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Hule kwayikoku Phethiro unobakuludzila kuti besimidzile hapa beli mukudziyidzika (1 Phethiro 4.12-5.11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unofidza lukwalo gugwe (1 Phethiro 5.12-14).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Kubva kuna Phethiro, mpositoli waYesu Khirisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Kubakahalugwa beNdzimu bakatihha bakapalalila mumitunhu yose yePhontiyu, yeGalathiya, yeKhapadosiya, yeAsiya, neBhithiniya, <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />bakahalugwa sezibgwa kwabo neNdzimu ibo Tate, ngeyengemadziwa ngeMeya, kuti bawhilile Yesu Khirisitu kakale banyasiwe ngemalopa awe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Ngoni nekunyalala ngakuwande kumuli.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bugalibgwe Gupenyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Ndzimu ngaakudziwe, ibo Tate baHe wedu Yesu Khirisitu! Ngemawhilangoni awe makulukulu takatjizwagwa butshwa mubugalibgwe gupenyu gwakabva mukumuka kubafi kwaYesu Khirisitu, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />nemunhaka isingabole, isina hambgwa, isingahakale, yamakatjengetegwa kudzimu, <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />imwi bakadzibiligwa ngemasimba eNdzimu ngegalamoyo, kuyetila jidzo lakalindila zumbunugwa mulubaka gwebupelo.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Muna kose ikoku hanhani, nekene kwangwenuwali mungadziyidziwa nezwiliko zwakasiyana siyana kwelubakanyana, <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />zwiliko izwezwi zohha kudze kuti bugalimoyo gwenyu gwelebeswa gwakanaka kupinda zeezi linoti nekene lihakala lohogwa ngemoto, guthame kuti mulumbidziwe, mulemekedzewe kakale mukudziwe pakuzumbunugwa kwaYesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Nekene musakawumbona koga mowhundha, nekene musingawumbone ngwenuwali koga mogalamoyo muwunli kakale muhhele kuhanha kukulukulu kusingake kukalizanyisiwa ngematama, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />ngobe mowamutjila mitjelo yebugalimoyo gwenyu, ilo jidzo lemeya dzenyu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Balebesambeli bakalebesambeli nekwengoni dzakabe dzowhobe dzenyu bakahakisisa bakabhuzwisisa nekwejidzo ileli, <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />bakabhuzwisisa kuti kungabe nhu wakatini kene lubaka gupi gwakagutondekewa neMeya yaKhirisitu imubali hapa ilebesambeli nekwedziyidzika kwaKhirisitu nekudziwa kunowhotobela. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Kwakazumbunugwa kubali kuti abatozwihingila ibo koga banohingila imwi, muzwinhu zwatjilebgwa kumuli na ibabo bakasumikila ndebo mbuya kumuli ngeMeya Yakayengemala yakatumwa ibva kudzimu, batumwa bekudzimu bakayemula ntolo kuti bazwiwhisise zwinhu izwezwi.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Danigwa Kubutjilo Gwakayengemala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Ndizo ke baakanyani mikumbulo yenyu ilulamile hinga, muzwidzibe, kugalamoyo kwenyu ngakupelele mungoni dzinowhohha kumuli hapa kwezumbunugwa Yesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Sebana bananlayo, musitjayende ngenjemulo dzamakamunadzo musanhu mukaba neluzibo, <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />koga saku iye wakamudana akayengemala, namwi bo ibani bakayengemala mukuzwibhata kose, <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />ngobe lukwalo goti, “Ibani bakayengemala, ngobe imi ndakayengemala.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Saku hapa mutembezela muwundhana Tate iwhoyo unotonga umwe newumwe ngemihingo iye esingahalawule, tjilani muhla lubaka gose muli mubutaya gwenyu. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Muzibe kuti amuzosunungugwa ngezwinhu zwinohakala zwinonga siliva kene zeezi kubva mumilenje yenyu isina mano yamakadiyiwa nabo batategulu benyu, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />koga makasunungugwa ngemalopa anokudziwa kwazo aKhirisitu, anonga emhwizana isina nlandu kene bala. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Wakahalugwa kusanhu kukabambiwa hango, koga wakazumbunugwa mulubaka gwebupelo kuyetigwa imwi. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Muwunli muna kugalamoyo kuNdzimu, iye wakawumusa kubafi akawumpa gudzo kuyetila kuti kugalamoyo nekugalabgwe kwenyu kube kuNdzimu.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Saku makatjitjenesa meya dzenyu ngewhilila malebeswa kuyetila kuti mube neludo gwakwako ku amwe makamu, mudanane ngeludo gwelebeswa gunobva mumimoyo yakahalabvuka. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Ngobe amuzozwagwa butshwa ngembewu inopfusiwa, koga makazwagwa butshwa ngembewu isingapfusiwe, ngedama leNdzimu linogala tjoselele. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Ngobe lukwalo goti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Banhu bose banonga buhwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">negudzo labo lose longa luba lebuhwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Buhwa gopisiwa nehhuba, luba likowa,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />koga dama laHe logala tjoselele.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Dama ilelo indebo mbuya yakasumikigwa kumuli.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Bgwe Linotjila Netjaba Tjakayengemala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Ndizo letjani lubengo gose netjebela kose, muletje butjengeli nendandala netukana kene kwayipi zila. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Sebana batjetjana, yemulani nkaka mbuyanana wemeya, kudze mutubule kula mudza munoswika mukutjidziwa, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />ngobe imwi makatjilabila lulama kwaHe.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Ihhani kuwunli, kubgwe ilelo linotjila, lakalambiwa nebabaki, koga mbeli kweNdzimu lakahalugwa kakale lolemekedzewa, <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />semabgwe anotjila ke imwi tjekwenyu mobakiwa mukaba n'umba yemeya, kuti mube baphirisiti bakayengemala, banowhopila zwibhayilo zwemeya zwinowamutjilika kuNdzimu nentha yaYesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Ngobe lukwalo goti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Lingani, ndobiga bgwe muZiyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">bgwe linotambunudza mbako lakahalugwa kakale libuya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">iye unogalamoyo muwunli atowhobhakhwa nehoni.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Kumuli imwi munogalamoyo, bgwe ileli libuya, koga kuna ibabo basingagalemoyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">“Bgwe ilo tjekwalo lakalambiwa nebabaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">ndilo latjiba bgwe linotambunudza mbako,”<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />kakale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Ibgwe linowhokunha banhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">ihongwe inowhobaliga.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Banokunhiwa nentha yesawhilila dama, sekwabakalingiligwa kuti bakuthame.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Koga imwi muludzi gwakahalugwa, baphirisiti baMambo, tjaba tjakayengemala, banhu beNdzimu, kuti musumikile mihingo yakanaka ya iwhoyo wakamudana emudusa muhhalima emusa mutjedza tjitje tjinotjenamisa. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Makatongobe musi banhu beNdzimu koga ngwenu mabe banhu beNdzimu, makatongobe musakawhigwa ngoni koga ngwenu matjiwhigwa ngoni.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balanda beNdzimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Badikani, ndomukumbilisisa sebezi nebataya kuti muthubukane nezwinhu zwinodiwa nembili zwinogwisana nemeya dzenyu. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Tjilani butjilo guna mazwibhato pakati kweBataya, kuyetila kuti hapa beleba nekwenyu beti mubatjinyi, babone mihingo yenyu yakanaka balumbidze Ndzimu muhhuba laanotikumba.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Muzwitebamise kubatungamili bose behango mukuyetila kuti muhanhise He, kungaba mambo, iye upehhugwi, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />kene babhati bemitunhu, sekwabakatumwa nayiye kuti balange ibabo banotjinya nekudza ibabo banothama ndulamo. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ngobe kuda kweNdzimu kuti ngethama ndulamo makafanila nyaladza zwilengwe zwisina luzibo. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Tjilani sebanhu bakasununguka, koga musingahingise lusununguko gwenyu mufumika zwibi, koga tjilani sebalanda beNdzimu. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Lemekedzani banhu bose, mude makamu, muhle Ndzimu, mulemekedze mambo.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tjilakidzilo Tjedziyila kwaKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Balanda, muzwitebamise nemazwibhato ose kuna bobatezi bose, musikuthame kuna bakalulama nebana moyonlefu koga, koga muzwitebamise nekuna ibabo banomutshambidzila. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ngobe tjinhu tjakanaka kwazo hapa umwe nhu edzikitidza alimumagwadzo nedziyidziwa kusakafanila, ngobe egalabgwe muNdzimu. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Ngobe komubhatsha neni, hapa mulobegwa tjinya mukodzikitidza? Koga hapa mudziyidzigwa thama tjakalulama mukodzikitidza, ikoku kobokeka kuNdzimu. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Ngobe makadanigwa ikoku, ngobe Khirisitu bo wakadziyilila imwi, emusiyila tjilakidzilo, kuti mutshambe munhambo dzidze. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Haazotongotjinya, tjebela akuzotongobhuda munlomo uwe. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Wakati etukwa, haazotongobatuka bo, wakati edziyila, haazotongobahlisidzila, koga wakagalamoyo kuna iye unotonga kwakalulama. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Khirisitu tjekukwe wakasenga matjinyo edu mumbili uwe patjileyanyo, kudze kuti tife mumatjinyo titjile mundulamo. Ngemabanga awe makatjidziwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Ngobe maka munga mhwizi dzakalahika, koga ngwenu matjihandukila kuNlisi neNtjengeti wemeya dzenyu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Balume neBafumakadzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Sayikoku, imwi bo bafumakadzi, muzwitebamise kubalume benyu, kudze kuti, hapa kuna bamwe basingagalemoyo dama, bangahandugwa ngentha yemazwibhato ebafumakadzi babo kusina matama alebgwa kubali, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />hapa bebona hla kwenyu Ndzimu nebubuya gwekuzwibhata kwenyu. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Kuzwinakisa kwenyu kusibe kwakuhhe seluka mavudzi, kene mbala ndalama dzezeezi, nembala zwiyambalo zwakanaka, <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />koga ngakube kunobva mumoyo, naka kusingahakale kwemeya yakatebama kakale yakadzikama, ndiko kunatjilemela tjikulu mbeli kweNdzimu. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Ngobe iyeyi ndiyo zila bafumakadzi bantolo bakayengemala bakabegalamoyo kuNdzimu, yabakabe bezwinakisa nayo. Bakabezwitebamisa kubalume babo, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />sa Sara waka ewhilila Abhurahhamu, ewundhana eti he. Matjibe bana babe hapa muthama tjakalulama kusina tjimwe tjinomuhlisa.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Sayikoku bo imwi balume, galani zwibuyanana nebafumakadzi benyu, mubalemekedze mubawhisisa kuti abana masimba samwi, saku mose muli bagalinhaka bengoni dzebutjilo, kuyetila kuti mitembezelo yenyu isibe netjinoyidzibila.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dziyilila Thama Tjakatambunuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Tjebupelo, imwi mose, ibani ban'ompela mumeya, muwhilane ngoni, mudane semakamu, mube nemoyo wakanaka nemikumbulo yakatebama. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Musibgwilizile tjibi netjibi, koga kombolelani, ngobe nditjo tjamakadanigwa kuti muwane makombolelo. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Ngobe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Iwhoyo unoda butjilo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">kakale ehaka bona mahhuba akanaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">ngaaletje leba zwibi ngelulimi gugwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">aletje neleba manyepwa nenlomo uwe;<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />ngaaletje thama tjibi athame kwakalulama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">ngaahake kunyalala akutobelele.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Ngobe meho aHe akalinga bakalulama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">nezebe dzidze dzowha mitembezelo yabo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">Koga He unoleyana nebanothama tjakayipa.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Ndiyani unowhomuwhisa zogwadza hapa muzwipila thama tjakalulama? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Nekene mudziyila nentha yethama tjakalulama, mowhokombolegwa. Musibahle, kene dziyidzika, <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />koga mumimoyo yenyu lemekedzani Khirisitu saHe. Mugale makazwibaakanyila handula kene yani unomubhuzwa nekwekugalabgwe kumumuli, koga mukuthame nekutebama nangemazwibhato, <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />mutjengete hana dzenyu dzili mbuyanana, kudze kuti, hapa mutukwa, ibabo banomutuka ngemazwibhato enyu akanaka muna Khirisitu babhakhwe nehoni. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Ngobe kuhine dziyilila thama tjakalulama, hapa kuli kuti kuda kweNdzimu, pana dziyilila thama tjakayipa. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Ngobe Khirisitu bo wakafila matjinyo kan'ompela tjatjose, iye wakalulama ekuyetila basakalulama, kuti atihhise kuNdzimu, wakabulawa mumbili koga akamusigwa kubutjilo mumeya, <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />ngobe wakayenda akanosumikila kumeya dzimubusungwa, <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />meya dzebasakawhilila mulubaka gwakapinda, Ndzimu paakaba nemoyonlefu mumahhuba aNowa, mulubaka kubakiwa kepe. Mutjili kwakatjidziwa banhu bahomanana, balihhanakadzi koga, bakatjidziwa ngevula. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Umfananidzo webvubikiwa, unomutjidza ngwenu bo, bvubikiwa kusikwedusa hambgwa imumbili koga kuli kumbila hana mbuyanana kuNdzimu, ngekumuka kubafi kwaYesu Khirisitu, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />wakatjiyenda kudzimu kakale watjibe kuluboko gweludli gweNdzimu, nebatumwa bekudzimu banowuwhilila, nebutungamili gunowuwhilila nemasimba anowuwhilila.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Tjilila Ndzimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Ndizo saKhirisitu akadziyidzika mumbili, ibani nenkumbulo wakafanana na iwhoyo, ngobe kene yani unodziyidzika mumbili kobva kuti wakathubukana nejinyo, <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />kuyetila kuti atjile butjilo gugwe gose muno muhango kusi ngenjemulo dzembili koga ngekuda kweNdzimu. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Lubaka gwakapinda makamuthama tjinodiwa neBataya, mutjila nekusazwibhata, mutjila munjemulo dzinohemesa, nemukulaladza, muyeta mizano inazwinolaladzisa ihhele kusazwibhata, kakale munamata zwidzimwana. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Banotjenamisiwa nekuti amutjazwihanganya nabo mukuzwibhata kwabo kwakayipa, ndizo bemutuka, <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />koga banowhozwihandulila kuna iye watjilulamila tonga bapenyu nebafi. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Ndizo ndiko ndebo mbuya yakasumikigwa kene kubafi, nekuti nekene bakatongewa munyama sebanhu, batjile mumeya seNdzimu.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Batjengeti Bezwipo zweNdzimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Bupelo gwezwinhu zose gwabepedlo, ndizo mikumbulo yenyu ngayitambunuke kakale muzwidzibe kuyetila kuti mutubule tembezela. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Pehhugwi kwezwinhu zose bhatililani paludo gusingapele mudane, ngobe ludo gofukidza matjinyo manjinji. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Yendilani mbeli muwamutjilana zwakanaka musingan'un'urike. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Se umwe newumwe wenyu akawamutjila tjipo, makafanila tjihingisa bhatsha bamwe, sebatjengeti babuya bengoni dzeNdzimu dzakasiyana siyana, <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />hapa kene yani elebeleka, ngaalebeleke se unolebeleka matama eNdzimu, kene yani unohinga, ngaahinge se unohinga ngesimba linobva kuNdzimu, kuyetila kuti mutjimwe netjimwe Ndzimu akudziwe muna Yesu Khirisitu. Gudzo nemasimba ndekukwe nekusingapele. Akujalo.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dziyilila BuKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Badikani, musitjenamisiwe nezwiliko zwinohlisa zwinomuwila zwiwhomulika, sekunonga kunoyi kunatjimwe tjinhu tjisakawholobeleka tjinoyetika kumuli. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Koga ke hanhani saku muhanganyila mukudziyidzika kwaKhirisitu, kudze muhanhe bo kwazo hapa gudzo lile lizumbunugwa. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Hapa mutukwa nentha yezina laKhirisitu, makakombolegwa, ngobe Meya yegudzo, Meya yeNdzimu igele mumuli. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Koga kusibe ne umwe wenyu unodziyidziwa nentha yekuti umbulayi, kene imbava, kene unoyeta zwibi, kene unoda zwinginisa mundebo dzebamwe banhu, <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />koga hapa udziyidziwa nentha yekuti uNkhirisitu, usibe nehoni, koga kudza Ndzimu kuti wakasenga zina laKhirisitu.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Ngobe lubaka gwatjiswika kuti tongewa kutangile kuna ibabo ben'umba yeNdzimu, ngono hapa kuli kuti kotangila kutili, bupelo gwayibabo basingawhilile ndebo mbuya yeNdzimu gowhoba tjini? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Selukwalo guti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“Hapa kulema kunhu wakalulama kuti atjidziwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">kowhoba tjini ke ngono kuntjinyi usingahle Ndzimu?”<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Ndizo ke, ibabo banodziyidziwa kuyendidzana nekuda kweNdzimu ngabathame mihingo yakalulama base meya dzabo kuMbumbi iye unogalikabgwe.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Gubungano leNdzimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Ndizo ndokuludzila bawhola bapakati kwenyu, senhu whola bo kakale sensupi wedziyidziwa kwaKhirisitu kakale ndili umwe unohanganyila mugudzo linowhozumbunugwa. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Tjengetani gubungano leNdzimu lamuli balisi balo, koga musikuthame ngekubhakhwa nemasimba koga mukuthame makahalabvuka seda kweNdzimu, musingakuyetile wana fumwa koga mukuthame ngekuzwipila, <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />musingatshambidzile ibabo bamunotungamila koga mubezwilakidzilo kugubungano. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Hapa Nlisi Nkulu ezumbunugwa mowhowamutjila tjiyala tjegudzo tjisingahakale.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Nezila iyeyi zwayo, imwi batjetjana muzwitebamise kubawhola. Mose muzwitebamise umwe kuwumwe, ngobe, “Ndzimu unogwisana nebanhu banozwikudza, koga unangoni kuna banozwitebamisa.” <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Muzwitebamise kumasimba makulu eNdzimu, kuti hapa lubaka gwaswika amumilidze. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Kose kunomudziyidza mukuse kuwunli, ngobe unomutjengeta.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Galani makamuka, mulinde. Tjita tjenyu Satane unosumha sumha kose ebomba sehumba inohaka wayingadla. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Muwundzibise, mubhatilile mubugalimoyo gwenyu, muziba kuti makamu enyu anodziyila kunofanana na ikoku hango yose. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Hule kwekube matjitongodziyila kwelubakanyana, Ndzimu wengoni dzose, wakamudanila kugudzo lile lisingapele muna Khirisitu, iye tjekukwe unowhomuthama bakapelela, akamupa matatabuko kakale akamuwahha kakale akamusimisa. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Ndzimu ngaabe nemasimba ngekusingapele. Akujalo.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buyisa Kwebupelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Ngebhatsho laSilivenasi, gamu linogalikamoyo sekwandinowunziba, ndamukwalila ngebufupi, ndimukuludzila kakale ndimupa busupi kuti idzedzi ndidzo ngoni dzeNdzimu dzemalebeswa, simani mudzili.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Gubungano lekuBhabhiloni, ilo lakahagwa bo samwi, lomubuyisa, nenkololo wangu Mako unomubuyisa bo. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Mubuyisane ngeputana kweludo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Kunyalala ngakube kumuli mose imwi bamuna Khirisitu.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>